  "label": "Humor Through Situational Irony",
  "description": "The humor in the meme stems from the situational irony of animals (baboons) being portrayed as confused or frustrated, as if they are humans who have been misled. This requires the audience to understand that the image is not literal but is being used metaphorically to represent human experience, which is a common comedic device in internet culture.",
